Z||000001||Patrick's Dad||06-08-2001||10:46 PM||||Wow, that would be neat to see.<P>Picked up a movie of "Nightfall," a short story which was his first sale. Basic premise (if you didn't already know) was, What would a society be like that lived in a multiple star system, and, therefore, only experienced night every few thousand years? The movie sucked. It didn't really follow the story well (Although it wouldn't have been interesting to watch two "scientists" speculating about night in an office for two hours), and took the weird road in its interpretation||||reg||1
